 "deepDive": {
  "domain": "Society: education, labor, immigration + Environment, energy & disasters + Infrastructure, transport & housing",
  "title": "When the systems people rely on stop working",
  "body": "This week the shared systems that daily life runs on failed in all three countries, and each failure shows a different weak point.\n\n**Old equipment in the US.** On Friday the FAA stopped every departure in the country for about four hours after communications failed at several air-traffic centres. Transportation Secretary Duffy blamed an outdated system and asked Congress for $50 billion to replace it. Officials doubt it was a cyberattack, but the FAA has not yet said what caused it. The request goes to a lame-duck Congress that already has to fund the government by Dec 11. [Fox Business](https://www.foxbusiness.com/fox-news-us/nationwide-faa-ground-stop-lifted-cancellations-significant-delays-continue-transportation-secretary)\n\n**A deliberate attack in Poland.** ePUAP, the portal Poles use to sign documents and contact offices, has been offline for days. The government says the attack came from abroad and was meant to paralyse offices in December. No restoration date has been given, so services from civil-registry extracts to residence registration are stuck. [Rzeczpospolita](https://cyfrowa.rp.pl/bezpieczenstwo/art45478321-epuap-nie-dziala-atak-hakerski-mial-sparalizowac-polske-dopiero-za-miesiac)\n\n**Air, weather and dry fields in India.** On Nov 13 Delhi’s air reached the ‘severe’ band. Rajasthan declared drought relief worth ₹9,321 crore, and a storm that may become Cyclone Akvan is forming in the Bay of Bengal. The Supreme Court hears the air-pollution case again on Nov 16.\n\n**Kraków.** The city’s problems are slower ones: a General Plan that is overdue and now being relaunched, and Clean Transport Zone exemptions that drivers must renew from Nov 17, with fees set to rise in 2027 unless the council freezes them. After the attack the city is also trying to fund a joint emergency dispatch centre. All of these depend on the 2027 budget the mayor is due to present. [krakow.pl](https://krakow.pl/aktualnosci/345718,29,komunikat,plan_ogolny_miasta_krakowa__nowe_otwarcie.html)\n\n*Analysis.*",
